{
    "title": "Spades Royale",
    "description": "Play Spades and experience the festive thrill! Spades Royale is a thrilling classic card game! Play and enjoy fun features, and get ready for an unforgettable gaming experience!\r\n\r\nJoin the biggest SPADES community in the world and play fun card games for free with millions of online players from around the world!\r\n\r\nPlay your favorite classic game and discover an amazing social experience, exciting challenges, different modes, and special tables. This is the only Spades app that offers live video chat party tables!\r\n\r\nBeach Bum, the creative team behind the app is proud to present you with the amazing Spades app \"SPADES ROYALE\" with classic modes and features such as bidding, blind nil, cutthroat, nil bids, and joker!\r\n\r\nIf you love to play classic card games, then Spades Royale is the right card game for you. Download for free and join the fun today!\r\nTrain your brain and compete for the King or Queen of Spades title! Go to multiplayer mode to play live plus chat with other Spades Players from all around the world!\r\n\r\nPlay live the thrilling multiplayer free card game with other players near your skill level, providing a fair experience for everyone! Start playing Spades and discover how many card tricks you can take!\r\n\r\nPlay Online Multiplayer Card Game for Free\r\nSpades Royale is a classic multiplayer card game online. If you want to play live online card games with friends, pick up this amazing app and choose between modes like two-player or solo ('cutthroat spades').\r\n\r\nYou can also play multiplayer Spades online plus chat with other Spades Players!\r\n\r\nSpades Features:\r\n\r\nLive Online Card Play\r\n\u2660 Enjoy this social game with live players worldwide!\r\n\u2660 Play Solo Spades or in Partner mode in this 4 players card game\r\n\u2660 Competitive Leaderboards - Become the KING or QUEEN of spades!\r\n\u2660 HD Graphics and a Slick Design\r\n\u2660 Unique live trick-taking card games with chat\r\n\u2660 Several game options, like solo spades or partner mode\r\n\u2660 Outstanding card animations\r\nBid and Win\r\n\u2666 Free Coin Bonuses Hourly & Daily!\r\n\u2666 Play Spades with Blind Nil & Nil Bets\r\n\u2666 Master Game Challenges & Collect Royal Gems!\r\n\r\nUnlock New Challenges\r\n\u2663 Exciting Game Progression, Unlock New Features as you Level Up!\r\n\r\nGreat Social Experience\r\n\u2665 Meet new people and add them as friends to be their best partners or challenge them in games!\r\n\u2665 Invite your social media contacts to play card games with friends and get bonuses!\r\n\u2665 Unique Interactive & Custom Avatars\r\n\u2665 Use chat to stay in touch with other players\r\n\r\nIf you enjoy playing multiplayer online games and are familiar with terms like 'Queen of spades', 'Ace of spades' and know what 'trick taking' and 'trickster' means, then you will love the app. FREE Spades & FUN - live, online card game with friends and social media contacts. \r\n\r\n Play the live multiplayer game that will feel like you\u2019re playing card games in Vegas!\r\n\r\nSpades Rules\r\nSpades Royale is a trick-taking card game similar to popular top card games. However, in this social free card game, trickster spades always trump! It\u2019s not another Solitaire game - try online spades now with additional modes: bidding, blind nil, cutthroat, nil bids, and joker.\r\n\r\nHow to Play Spades\r\nLive Spades is a multiplayer 4-player game where all four players bid on a number of card tricks. If a player bids Blind nil, this top-card game goes crazy! It is a Vegas card game you can also play in a solo mode without a partner. The rules are simple!\r\n\r\nThis game is only available to users of legal age. Winning any valuable items or money is not possible while playing this game. Additionally, your success in this game does not guarantee success in a comparable real-money casino game.\r\n\r\nLike us on social media Facebook for FREE COIN OFFERS! https://www.facebook.com/spadesroyale/\r\n\r\nHave any suggestions? Contact the Beach Bum team at support@spadesroyale.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Play Spades and experience the festive thrill! Spades Royale is a thrilling classic card game! Play and enjoy fun features, and get ready for an unforgettable gaming experience!<br><br>Join the biggest SPADES community in the world and play fun card games for free with millions of online players from around the world!<br><br>Play your favorite classic game and discover an amazing social experience, exciting challenges, different modes, and special tables. This is the only Spades app that offers live video chat party tables!<br><br>Beach Bum, the creative team behind the app is proud to present you with the amazing Spades app &quot;SPADES ROYALE&quot; with classic modes and features such as bidding, blind nil, cutthroat, nil bids, and joker!<br><br>If you love to play classic card games, then Spades Royale is the right card game for you. Download for free and join the fun today!<br>Train your brain and compete for the King or Queen of Spades title! Go to multiplayer mode to play live plus chat with other Spades Players from all around the world!<br><br>Play live the thrilling multiplayer free card game with other players near your skill level, providing a fair experience for everyone! Start playing Spades and discover how many card tricks you can take!<br><br>Play Online Multiplayer Card Game for Free<br>Spades Royale is a classic multiplayer card game online. If you want to play live online card games with friends, pick up this amazing app and choose between modes like two-player or solo (&#39;cutthroat spades&#39;).<br><br>You can also play multiplayer Spades online plus chat with other Spades Players!<br><br>Spades Features:<br><br>Live Online Card Play<br>\u2660 Enjoy this social game with live players worldwide!<br>\u2660 Play Solo Spades or in Partner mode in this 4 players card game<br>\u2660 Competitive Leaderboards - Become the KING or QUEEN of spades!<br>\u2660 HD Graphics and a Slick Design<br>\u2660 Unique live trick-taking card ga